cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or cite the digest as an aggregation, please
  cite it as below. For factual claims about government actions, cite
  the underlying official source that each digest item links to; cite
  FAPD for the aggregation itself.
title: "Free Agentic Publication Digester (FAPD)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Karnowski
    given-names: David D.
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidkarnowski/free-agentic-publication-digester"
url: "https://fapd.info"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - government-transparency
  - federal-register
  - congressional-record
  - civic-tech
  - ai-agents
abstract: >-
  A daily, cited, opinion-agnostic digest of official United States
  federal publications — congressional proceedings, bills, the Federal
  Register, enacted laws, court opinions, and agency releases — built
  only from primary sources, for human readers and AI agents. Digest
  content is licensed CC BY 4.0; quoted official government text is
  public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105).
